        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 47</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 47" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="571" ed="#liebermann"/>(C. XLVII<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.3"/>) De causis criminalibus uel capitalibus. De<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="4" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.4"/> furto et murdro et prodicione domini et<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="5" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.5"/> robaria<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="6" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.6"/> et utlagaria et<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="7" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.7"/> husbreche et bernet et falsaria et causis criminalibus uel capitalibus nemo querat<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.8"/> consilium, quin<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.9"/> inplacitatus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="10" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.10"/> statim<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.11"/> perneget<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="c" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.c"/> sine omni peticione consilii, cuiuscunque nacionis uel condicionis sit: uel eius affirmacionem uel negacionem defensor<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="d" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.d"/> aut dominus prosequatur competenti termino comprobandam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#Hn_47.lnote.oe.12"/>.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 571 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
